{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts#L102","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts:102"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A serializable snapshot of a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":"'s cache, as produced by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"dehydrate"},{"type":"text","value":" and consumed by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hydrate"},{"type":"text","value":". Typically\ntransported from server to client (e.g. embedded in server-rendered markup) to seed the client's cache with data\nthat has already been fetched, avoiding a redundant fetch on the client."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Property"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-mutations\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutations"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DehydratedMutation"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The dehydrated mutations, by default only the paused ones."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-queries\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DehydratedQuery"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The dehydrated queries, by default only the successful ones."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts:102](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts#L102)\n\nA serializable snapshot of a `QueryClient`'s cache, as produced by `dehydrate` and consumed by `hydrate`. Typically\ntransported from server to client (e.g. embedded in server-rendered markup) to seed the client's cache with data\nthat has already been fetched, avoiding a redundant fetch on the client.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-mutations\"></a> `mutations` | `DehydratedMutation`[] | The dehydrated mutations, by default only the paused ones. |\n| <a id=\"property-queries\"></a> `queries` | `DehydratedQuery`[] | The dehydrated queries, by default only the successful ones. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DehydratedState\ntitle: DehydratedState\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts:102](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts#L102)\n\nA serializable snapshot of a `QueryClient`'s cache, as produced by `dehydrate` and consumed by `hydrate`. Typically\ntransported from server to client (e.g. embedded in server-rendered markup) to seed the client's cache with data\nthat has already been fetched, avoiding a redundant fetch on the client.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-mutations\"></a> `mutations` | `DehydratedMutation`[] | The dehydrated mutations, by default only the paused ones. |\n| <a id=\"property-queries\"></a> `queries` | `DehydratedQuery`[] | The dehydrated queries, by default only the successful ones. |\n"}
